{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0cb635a690c92d397dfb9447e8e4d96937d86c8ffaa8500a5684cb44d40a9864"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Approval cards support single and batch confirmation with diff previews, and a feedback field lets the agent revise and re-request a rejected proposal."},{"claim_ids":["clm_33d1f7d42d10d23d0ee7ab7dd06a7c41055de93b3c857fd8cc2e34277083a46f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Behavior approvals are independent of global mode: even in Auto, switching Unity Editor/Play Mode state or editing protected knowledge folders can be set to require confirmation."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d5711a0312ab356d119a9d610212c77b2824bbffd49a9f75ccc48da68e50cc01"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tool execution has two modes: Auto runs all tools without approval, while Ask requires per-tool confirmation; read tools default to auto-run and modifying tools (write, edit, bash, web_fetch, unity_execute, unity_run_states, subagent) default to confirmation."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ff9ba47623d7dd3751177d295a7962f6593f4acf8f4c1b7add564eb754cfa22f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A File Tool Boundary setting can restrict file tools to the current project directory; by default (All) paths outside the workspace are allowed."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0cb635a690c92d397dfb9447e8e4d96937d86c8ffaa8500a5684cb44d40a9864","clm_33d1f7d42d10d23d0ee7ab7dd06a7c41055de93b3c857fd8cc2e34277083a46f","clm_d5711a0312ab356d119a9d610212c77b2824bbffd49a9f75ccc48da68e50cc01","clm_ff9ba47623d7dd3751177d295a7962f6593f4acf8f4c1b7add564eb754cfa22f"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:33:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_34160a88902d4873a345624faab3e6ae","id":"pg_5d4b87d478e650c29fbf302934bc59b3","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/r1n7aro-locus-docs-sessions-permissions-mdx-52e714341f53-302934bc59b3.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_a09b09dc2bbc5c62841f2ff42ee6b9df"],"title":"r1n7aro/Locus/docs